SUMMARY:Carmina Burana with Toronto Beach Chorale
DESCRIPTION:Carl Orff’s spectacular masterpiece arranged for two pianos and percussion will be performed by Toronto Beach Chorale with Mississauga Chamber Singers\, soprano Nune Ananyan\, tenor Benjamin Done\, bass Alexander Hajek\, Ron Greidanus and Adolfo DeSantis pianos\, and TorQ percussion quartet.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/carmina-burana-with-toronto-beach-chorale/
LOCATION:Kingston Road United Church\, 975 Kingston Rd
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/19092636/Carmina_2026_Eventbrite-2.jpg
