SUMMARY:The Riverdale Open Mic Night
DESCRIPTION:The next session of The Riverdale Mic is quickly approaching! Save the date for Friday May 1\, 2026 from 6:30-8:30PM at St. Matthew’s Clubhouse!\n🎤\nFor this upcoming open mic night\, local writers\, poets\, musicians\, and creative folks are all invited to join us to have some fun together. Plus\, Scarborough-based artist Jonathan Wilson and A.F.R.O. Labs will be joining us for a special takeover of some performance spots to help spotlight spoken word artists in the east end!\n🎤\nNo pre-registration is required. Doors open at 6:30pm with signup at the door and performances starting at 7pm. This is your chance to showcase your talent (in 5 minutes or less) in front of a supportive audience on the edge of Riverdale Park. Light snacks and refreshments are provided! Learn more here: https://eastendarts.ca/the-riverdale-mic/\n🎤\nCost: FREE to participate\nDate: Friday May 1\, 2026\nTime: 6:30-8:30PM\nLocation: St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Ave.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/the-riverdale-open-mic-night/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24172825/Mic-IGsm.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
