SUMMARY:Artists & Artisans Spring Market
DESCRIPTION:Handcrafted items and beautiful works of art including bags\, crochet\, jewelry\, home decor\, woodcrafts\, books\, baked goods\, ceramics\, paper crafts\, 3D art\, chocolates\, candles\, soap\, bath bombs and more. After all that shopping take a break in the cafe and enjoy sandwiches\, baked treats and refreshments.
